flowchart TD
    A[Cliente REST/SOAP] -->|POST REST o SOAP| B{Proxy}
    B -->|REST| C[GetFundPensionClientRestPS<br/>/regional/pension/rest/v1]
    B -->|SOAP Regional| D[GetFundPensionClientSoapPS<br/>/regional/pension/soap/v1]
    B -->|SOAP 11g| E[GetFundPensionClient11gPS<br/>/regional/pension/soap/v11g]

    C --> F[GetFundPensionClientPP<br/>Template: PensionRegionalTemplateFicohsa]
    D --> F

    E --> G[GetFundPensionClient11gPP<br/>Template: PensionRegional11gTemplate]

    %% Flujo 11g
    G --> H[ConvertIdType.Xquery<br/>1→CC, 9→NIT, 4→PAS, 2→CAR]
    H --> I[Virtual11gToRegional.Xquery<br/>Transforma request 11g → regional]
    I --> J[GetFundPensionClient12BS<br/>SOAP mwservices.gfficohsa.hn:8020]
    J --> K[RegionalToVirtualHeader11gHN.Xquery<br/>+ RegionalToVirtualBody11gHN.Xquery]
    K --> L[Response 11g al cliente]

    %% Flujo Regional
    F --> M[StageDefinitions<br/>service, version, key, method, uuid, sourceBank, destinationBank]
    M --> N[StageLoggingInput<br/>LoggingRegionalRestBS - REQUEST]
    N --> O[StageValidate<br/>XSD: getFundPensionClient]
    O --> P{Validación OK?}
    P -->|No| Q[Error Handler Global]
    P -->|Sí| R[StageRegionalitation<br/>GetCountryURLByNameRestBS]
    R --> S{responseRegional = N/A?}
    S -->|Sí| T[Error MW-0008<br/>SERVICE NOT IMPLEMENTED]
    S -->|No| U[InvokeCountry<br/>GetFundPensionClientRestBS<br/>URL dinámica]
    U --> V[StageLoggingOutput<br/>LoggingRegionalRestBS - RESPONSE]
    V --> W{method=REST AND Status!=SUCCESS?}
    W -->|Sí| X[Inyectar HTTP code de error]
    W -->|No| Y[Response al cliente]
    X --> Y

    %% Error Handler
    Q --> Z[StageIT - Report fault]
    Z --> AA[StageMappingErrors<br/>GetCustomErrorByStackTraceRegionalRestBS]
    AA --> AB[ErrorToGetFundPensionClient.Xquery]
    AB --> AC{method=REST?}
    AC -->|Sí| AD[Inyectar HTTP code]
    AC -->|No| AE[Reply Error]
    AD --> AE
